TINationTemplate.unionDisplayNameWithArticlePrep.IMP=in the Imperium of Mankind
TINationTemplate.displayName.IND=Hive Cities of Indoi
TINationTemplate.displayNameWithArticle.IND=the Hive Cities of Indoi
TINationTemplate.nationAdjective.IND=Indoian
