TIFactionTemplate.CampaignStartHeadline.ImperialCouncil=Unite Humanity
TIFactionTemplate.CampaignStart.ImperialCouncil=<i>It is a time of unrelenting war upon the bloody sands of Terra.</i><br/><br/>It has been several decades since you have emerged to lead the shattered remmnants of humanity into a new age. It began with tallying the scattered tribes of the Himalazias, uniting them under the Lightning Bolt and the Raptor. Through diplomacy and guile, many tribes have been convinced to join you, bringing their resources and expertiese to your banner. Other tribes have resisted, only to fall under the boots of your newly-crafted Thunder Warriors.<br/><br/>Yet more techno-barbraian warlords and despots remain to depose, and bring their scattered followers unduer the <i>Rapor Imperialis'</i> wing. The other major powers have taken note of your growing influence, and may take action to crush their new rival. The Great King of Akkad, in particular, has begun raiding settlements in the northwestern Pamir Mountains. Strike swiftly, and humanity may become united once again!
TIFactionTemplate.Introduction.ImperialCouncil=We have encountered {0}.<br/><br/>The leaders of this group are convinced the aliens are a threat to humanity's ability to determine its own future, and they are quietly preparing to fight them.<br/><br/>{4}<br/>   - {1} {2} {3}
TIFactionTemplate.Introduction.OrkCouncil=We have our first direct sighting of {0}.
TIFactionTemplate.Quote.ImperialCouncil=<align="right">"We must not only defend human lives from the aliens; we must ensure those lives remain worth living."<align="left">
TIFactionTemplate.Goal.ImperialCouncil=Unify Humanity under one banner
TIFactionTemplate.Victory.ImperialCouncil=Build a fleet to embark on a Great Crusade
TIFactionTemplate.WinNotification.ImperialCouncil={0} forces have detonated a weapon to shut down the alien wormhole in the outer Solar System, stranding the alien forces here and dooming them to defeat.
TIFactionTemplate.VictoryNotification.ImperialCouncil=My name is {1}. I'm speaking for the global resistance against the alien invasion. We have captured an alien infiltrator and learned their true purpose is to enslave us all to use as foot soldiers in their wars against other species. They are operating out of a base located beyond Neptune. They are using a piece of technology called a wormhole to transport themselves from another star system. We have the means to close that wormhole permanently. Our forces will launch for their base to deliver this weapon. Do not interfere; we will defend ourselves against any attempt to stop us.
TIFactionTemplate.CampaignStartHeadline.MachineCouncil=Continue the Quest for Knowledge
TIFactionTemplate.CampaignStart.MachineCouncil=My Lord {0}, I am pleased to report the council has appointed you leader of {1}. I am {2}, your chief of staff.<br/><br/>While most of the world is reacting with fascination at the arrival of an alien species on Earth, we represent a small group who believes the alien’s crash-landing {3} and disappearance may signify a potential threat. We intend to build an international organization capable of investigating and, if necessary, combating any danger aliens may pose.<br/><br/><h>I recommend we send a councilor to investigate the crash site in the {4} region as soon as possible.  Our other councilors may be best used in trying to gain influence in nations that may be able to contribute resources to our cause.</h><br/><br/>You may review our objectives at any time by clicking our faction symbol in the top-left corner of your screen. // rank, council name, leader name
TIFactionTemplate.Introduction.MachineCouncil=We have encountered {0}.<br/><br/>They worshinp a being known as the Omnisiah.<br/><br/>{4}<br/>   - {1} {2} {3}
TIFactionTemplate.Quote.MachineCouncil=<align="right">"We must not only defend human lives from the aliens; we must ensure those lives remain worth living."<align="left">
TIFactionTemplate.Goal.MachineCouncil=Seek out Mankinds technological heritage
TIFactionTemplate.Victory.MachineCouncil=Build an Exploratory fleet to embark on the Quest for Knowledge
TIFactionTemplate.WinNotification.MachineCouncil={0} forces have detonated a weapon to shut down the alien wormhole in the outer Solar System, stranding the alien forces here and dooming them to defeat.
TIFactionTemplate.VictoryNotification.MachineCouncil=My name is {1}. I'm speaking for the global resistance against the alien invasion. We have captured an alien infiltrator and learned their true purpose is to enslave us all to use as foot soldiers in their wars against other species. They are operating out of a base located beyond Neptune. They are using a piece of technology called a wormhole to transport themselves from another star system. We have the means to close that wormhole permanently. Our forces will launch for their base to deliver this weapon. Do not interfere; we will defend ourselves against any attempt to stop us.
TIFactionTemplate.Fleet.ImperialCouncil=HMS-
TIFactionTemplate.Fleet.OrkCouncil=ORK-
TIFactionTemplate.Fleet.MachineCouncil=MRS-

HabModuleSpecialRule.Vault=-Contains a Vault that may be Explored by a Councilor for Archeotech and other rewards. Many Vault exploration attempts may result in the death of your Councillor, so be prepared for the dangers within!


