TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_Hurricane=Radiation Storm
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hurricane.summary=A massive radiation storm has struck the {targetRegionName} region {targetNationNameWithArticleAndPlacePrep}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hurricane.query=The damage is potentially horrific. We may mitigate the damage by directing funds and ops to the area.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hurricane.option0=That's terrible.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hurricane.optionDetail0=Do nothing.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hurricane.optionResult0={summary}
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hurricane.option1=Let's divert some resources to help out.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hurricane.optionDetail1=Send Aid.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hurricane.optionResult1={summary}

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_Typhoon=Chemical Typhoon
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Typhoon.summary=A large windstorm has kicked up industrial chemicals from waste pits from the Age of Strife and has struck the {targetRegionName} region {targetNationNameWithArticleAndPlacePrep}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Typhoon.query=The damage may be huge. We may mitigate the damage by directing funds and ops to the area.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Typhoon.option0=How awful.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Typhoon.optionDetail0=Do nothing.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Typhoon.optionResult0={summary}
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Typhoon.option1=Let's save whom we can.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Typhoon.optionDetail1=Send Aid.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Typhoon.optionResult1={summary}

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_Cyclone=Nanostorm
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Cyclone.summary=A huge cloud of malignent nanomachines from the Dark Age of Technology has struck the {targetRegionName} region {targetNationNameWithArticleAndPlacePrep}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Cyclone.query=The damage is potentially horrific. We may mitigate the damage by directing funds and ops to the area.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Cyclone.option0=Such a shame.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Cyclone.optionDetail0=Do nothing.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Cyclone.optionResult0={summary}
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Cyclone.option1=Let's send some troops to assist.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Cyclone.optionDetail1=Send Aid.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Cyclone.optionResult1={summary}






TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_Hivequake=Hivequake
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.summary=A hivequake has occurred at {targetHabSiteName} on {targetNaturalSpaceObjectName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.query=Poor structural stability has caused an entire section of {targetHabName} to collapse under its own weight.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.option0=Unfortunate.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.optionResult0={summary} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.option1=Retrieve whatever is salvagable.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.optionResult1={summary} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.option2=Search for any archeotech that may have been jostled loose.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.optionResult2={summary}
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.option3=Use our knowledge of archeotech to see if we can replace what was lost.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_Hivequake.optionResult3={summary} 



//Search for Archeotech Mission Events
TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1=Entering the Himalazian Gene-Labs
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} searches for knowledge in the Gene-Labs of the Emperor.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.query=The Himalazian Gene-Labs of the Emperor lie deep underground, requiring several elevator rides and checkpoint scans before entering the lab proper.  The Gene-labs are known to contain a great deal of data relating to the biological sciences, and is the home of the Imperial Biotechnical Division. There are also rumours of secret gene-splicing experments undertaken by the Emperor, but that would be protected by many firewalls and security protections.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option0=Browse the accessible datastacks for any interesting archival data.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.optionDetail0={targetCouncilorFullName} finds some information, but nothing of any true relevance.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.optionResult0={targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to find anything of interest in {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option1=Spend time carefully going through the datastacks for anything the adepts may have missed.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option1.outcome0=Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option1.outcome0.Summary={targetCouncilorFullName} discovered a more efficient Rejuvenat treatment in the Himalazian Gene-Labs.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option1.outcome0.Detail=While delving deep into the datastacks, {targetCouncilorFullName} managed to discover a data archive detailing an experimental rejuvenant treatment dating from the Dark Age of Technology. It never saw mass introduction, as the treatment was deemed too expensive at the time for mass use. However, the steroidal elixirs used in the treatment are replicable using the technology available at the Gene-Labs. This would aid in improving the lifespans of loyal agents of the Imperium, extending their usefulness. 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option1.outcome1=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option1.outcome1.Summary={targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to find anything of interest {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option1.outcome1.Detail=Even after weeks of research, {targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to find anything of interest. They did, however, inadvertently assist in cataloging part of the data archives in the process of their research. 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option2=Seek membership in the Biotechnical Division.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option2.outcome0=Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option2.outcome0.Summary={targetCouncilorFullName} was granted memership in the Biotechnical Division.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option2.outcome0.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was escorted to the Director's office. Your credentials are quite exemplary, and I judge you fit to be a member of our Division. May you contribute to the Emperor's great work.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option2.outcome1=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option2.outcome1.Summary={targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to gain membership in the Biotechnical Division.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option2.outcome1.Detail=Unfortunatly, {targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to persuade the bio-adepts of their fitness for membership in the division. This caused them great embarrassment.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option3=Attempt to find records of the Emperor's experiments.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option3.outcome0=Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option3.outcome0.Summary={targetCouncilorFullName} discovered records of the Emperor's gene-splicing experiments.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option3.outcome0.Detail=Although {targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to penetrate very far into the archives, they were able to find recordings of early gene-experiments in the creation of the Thunder Warriors.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option3.outcome1=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option3.outcome1.Summary={targetCouncilorFullName} was discovered and is being detained at {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHimalazianGeneLab1.option3.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to penetrate very far into the archives before being discovered by Imperial Security. They are now being detained at {secondaryTargetHabName}.

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1=Descending into the Underhive
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} searches for archeotech in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.query=In the Underhive, there is no law save for that created by the gangs that rule this dark ghetto. The lure of archeotech and relics from the Dark Age of Technology, however, lure many to brave its depths. The scale of the Underhive spans many kilometers of tunnels, warrens, and dome structures, so any expedition should be relativly brief and focus on specific areas of the underhive in order to be successful. 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0=Search the Abyssal Warrens
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.optionDetail0=The Abyssal Warrens are home to many enclaves of gangers, mutants, and outcasts. Collapsed tunnels are almost certain to block the way. There are rumours of a Vault from the Dark Age of Technology there.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome0=Collapsed Tunnels
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome0.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} is fortunate and managed to make their way deep into the Abyssal Warrens without encountering its hostile denizens. This portion of the Abyssal Warrens has many crisscrossing tunnels that have collapsed due to age. {targetCouncilorFullName} must find a way around, or through...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome1=Underhive Gang
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome1.Detail=It did not take long after descending into the depths of the Abyssal Warrens for {targetCouncilorFullName} to encounter evidence of the native denizens. Totems, markers, and signs of battle dot the path ahead, leading to an occupoied outpost.  A way through the claimed territory must be negotiated, or a show of force may be needed...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome2=Mutants
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option0.outcome2.Detail=It did not take long after descending into the depths of the Abyssal Warrens for {targetCouncilorFullName} to encounter some of its denizens. Fortunately, they seem unaware of their presence, for now...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.option1=Search the Overgrown Biodomes
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive1.optionDetail1=TODO
