TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant=Mutants Encountered
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} encounters a group of mutants in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.query=Human mutants are often terribly misshapen creatures, abominably deviating from the normal human form. This is no less true in the polluted and darkened tunnels of the Underhive. Unfortunatly, {targetCouncilorFullName} has come across an entire ramshackle village of them that impedes their current path. They are, for now, unaware of their presence.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0=Backtrack and take another path
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome0=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome0.Detail=Withdrawing and searching for a path around the mutants has paid off. A side tunnel that was previously unnoticed was discovered and allows {targetCouncilorFullName} to bypass the mutants. Unfortunalty, there was a good reason that it was unused...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome1=Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome1.Detail=No amount of backtracking brought to light any way around the path blocked by the mutants, and {targetCouncilorFullName} ended up right back where they started. The only sliver lining to this waste of time is that the mutants are still unaware of their presence.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome2=Spotted!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option0.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to withdraw, but managed to attract the attention of the mutants, who appear eager for a fight!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1=Fight them
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome0=Critical Success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome0.Detail=Whether their sentries were particularially lax or {targetCouncilorFullName} was particularly stealthy, it no longer matters. A single volley of shots was all it took to to turn these mutated horrors into twitching piles of flesh.  {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to see what it was they were guarding...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome1=Battle Advantage.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} manages to secure an advantageous firing position before engaging the mutants. Hopefully the battle will finish swiftly...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome2=Battle Disadvantage.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option1.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was out of cover and exposed when the mutants detected them. Hopefully the mutants will not be able to press their temporary advantage, or {targetCouncilorFullName} may not see the Sun again...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2=Create a distraction
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome0=Critical success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome0.Detail=This particular tribe of mutants made their hovels around several pipe-systems that carry various forms of promethium. No doubt to siphon off some of the precious fluid to serve as fuel in these lightless depths. Unfortunatly, their brief existences will be cut short by a few well-placed shots into the open reservoirs of the flammable liquid by {targetCouncilorFullName}. After the flames die down, a passage has been newly revealed that cuts through the back of the village. 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome1=Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} manages to distract the mutants by setting fire to one side of their hovels. As the horde rushes past to put out the fires, {targetCouncilorFullName} manages to slip past the few remaining sentries.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome2=Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option2.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName}'s attempt to distract the mutants has backfired horribly! The mutants' attention has been drawn towards their position, and it is only a matter of time before the horde is upon them...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3=Try to sneak past them
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome0=Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome0.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} managed to sneak past the mutant sentries and continue on their way.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome1=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was just about to reach the outer ring of mutant sentries when they were spotted. Fortunatly, the few sentries were quickly dispactched, but the sound of fighting has attracted the attention of the rest of the village. A fight has been forced, but will be fought from a relativly safe position. 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterMutant.option3.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was making their way through an alleyway of the village when an unexpected group of mutants appeared around the corner. The two sides looked at each other in brief shock, before the group of mutants let out their war cries, alerting the rest of the village. This battle will be hard-fought... 

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant=Battling the Mutants 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} battles a group of mutants in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.query=The mutants, armed with primitive autoguns and melee weapons, have detected {targetCouncilorFullName}, whether through their mutated senses, deliberate action on {targetCouncilorFullName}'s part, or poor luck. At this point, it matters not, for battle is joined!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0=Charge the Enemy!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome0=Critical Success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome0.Detail=The charge was successful! The mutants were not expecting the ferocious charge of {targetCouncilorFullName}, and they have routed in disarray. There is very little of note on the mutant corpses, save a crudely drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome1=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome1.Detail=The charge was unsuccessful. {targetCouncilorFullName} was forced to take cover as the return fire bcame too intense. A stray shot wounded them, but they are not out of the fight yet...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option0.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to charge the mutants, but the volley of fire directed their way was too intense. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the horrid cries of the mutants resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1=Use superior tactics to outmanuver them
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome0.Detail=Using superior battle tactics, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to outmanuver the mutants and defeat them in detail. The screams of the mutants fell silent as the last of them lie still. There is very little of note on the mutant corpses, save a crudely drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome1.Detail=Using battle tactics, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to outmanuver the mutants and defeat them in detail. However, they were wounded by a stray round. The screams of the mutants fell silent as the last of them lie still. There is very little of note on the mutant corpses, save a crudely drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option1.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to outmanuver the mutants, but the volley of fire directed their way was too intense. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the horrid cries of the mutants resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2=Search the battlefield for an advantage
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome0=Critical Success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome0.Detail=This particular group of mutants is near several pipe-systems that carry various forms of promethium. Unfortunatly, their brief existences will be cut short by a few well-placed shots which cause a massive explosion. After the flames die down, a passage has been newly revealed that leads to an unusual section of the underhive... 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome1=Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome1.Detail=This particular group of mutants is near several pipe-systems that carry various forms of promethium. Unfortunatly, their brief existences will be cut short by a few well-placed shots which cause a massive explosion. Unfortunatly, {targetCouncilorFullName} was wounded in the ensuing fireball. After the flames die down, a passage has been newly revealed that leads to an unusual section of the underhive... 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome2=Critical Failure 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option2.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to find an advantage on the battlefield, but none were to be found.  Their distraction cost them dearly as the mutants focused their fire on {targetCouncilorFullName}'s position. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the horrid cries of the mutants resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3=Command their retinue to assault the enemy
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome0=Critical success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome0.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command make quick work of the mutants, and they have routed in disarray. There is very little of note on the mutant corpses, save a crudely drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome1.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command make quick work of the mutants, and they have routed in disarray. However, some in {targetCouncilorFullName}'s retinue have fallen to the enemy. There is very little of note on the mutant corpses, save a crudely drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightMutant.option3.outcome2.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command attempt to hold off the horde, but there are simply too many of them. One after one, the members of {targetCouncilorFullName}'s retinue fall, slaughtered by the howling mutants. Finally, {targetCouncilorFullName} is all that remains. They succumb to their wounds as the world around them draws cold, with the horrid cries of the mutants resounding in their ears...

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss=Abyssal Gang Encountered
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} encounters a gang of rough-looking humans in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.query=Gangs are violent, territorial groups that can be found throughout the Hive Cities of Terra. Hive city gangs are often part of the powerful rival families or clans of the hives.  Unfortunatly, {targetCouncilorFullName} has come across what appears to be an outpost that impedes their current path. It is most likely that the gang has claimed this section of the hive as their territory, so they must either be eliminanted or {targetCouncilorFullName} granted safe passage.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0=Attempt to persuade them
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome0.Detail=The gangers are so swayed by {targetCouncilorFullName}'s noble quest to discover the secrets of the ancients that one of them has decided to join their retinue! Having secured safe passage through the gang's territory, {targetCouncilorFullName} continues on their expedition.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome1=Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} has managed to negotiate safe passage through their excellent oratory skills. Having secured safe passage through the gang's territory, {targetCouncilorFullName} continues on their expedition.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option0.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to persaude them, but managed to seriously offend the gang leader, who screams a battle cry!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1=Fight them
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome0=Critical Success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome0.Detail=Whether their sentries were particularially lax or {targetCouncilorFullName} was particularly stealthy, it no longer matters. A single volley of shots was all it took to to turn these dregs of humanity into twitching piles of flesh.  {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to see what it was they were guarding...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome1=Battle Advantage.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} manages to secure an advantageous firing position before engaging the gangers. Hopefully the battle will finish swiftly...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome2=Battle Disadvantage.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option1.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was out of cover and exposed when the gangers detected them. Hopefully the gangers will not be able to press their temporary advantage, or {targetCouncilorFullName} may not see the Sun again...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2=Attempt to bribe them
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome0=Critical success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome0.Detail=Most of the gangers are satisfied by the valuables traded to them, but one decides that there are greater prospects elsewhere, and decides to join {targetCouncilorFullName}'s retinue! Having secured safe passage through the gang's territory, {targetCouncilorFullName} continues on their expedition.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome1=Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome1.Detail=The gangers appear satisfied by the valuables traded to them. Having secured safe passage through the gang's territory, {targetCouncilorFullName} continues on their expedition.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome2=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option2.outcome2.Detail=The gangers reason that they can gain more wealth by ransoming {targetCouncilorFullName} to {actorNameWithArticleCap} and attack!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3=Intimidate the gang with the size of their retinue
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome0.Detail=The gangers are so intimidated by {targetCouncilorFullName}'s show of force that one of them has decided to join their retinue! Having secured safe passage through the gang's territory, {targetCouncilorFullName} continues on their expedition.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome1.Detail=The gangers are intimidated by {targetCouncilorFullName}'s show of force. Having secured safe passage through the gang's territory, {targetCouncilorFullName} continues on their expedition.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2EncounterGangAbyss.option3.outcome2.Detail=The gangers are unimpressed with {targetCouncilorFullName}'s attempt at indimidation, and attack!


TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss=Battling the Abyssal Gang 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} battles a gang of rough-looking humans in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.query=The gangers, armed with primitive autoguns and melee weapons, have spotted {targetCouncilorFullName}, whether through keen perception, deliberate action on {targetCouncilorFullName}'s part, or poor luck. At this point, it matters not, for battle is joined!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0=Charge the Enemy!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome0=Critical Success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome0.Detail=The charge was successful! The gangers were not expecting the ferocious charge of {targetCouncilorFullName}, and they have routed in disarray. There is very little of note on the ganger corpses, save a well-drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome1=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome1.Detail=The charge was unsuccessful. {targetCouncilorFullName} was forced to take cover as the return fire bcame too intense. A stray shot wounded them, but they are not out of the fight yet...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option0.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to charge the gangers, but the volley of fire directed their way was too intense. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the savage cries of the gangers resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1=Use superior tactics to outmanuver them
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome0.Detail=Using superior battle tactics, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to outmanuver the gangers and defeat them in detail. The screams of the gangers fell silent as the last of them lie still. There is very little of note on the ganger corpses, save a well-drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome1.Detail=Using battle tactics, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to outmanuver the gangers and defeat them in detail. However, they were wounded by a stray round. The screams of the gangers fell silent as the last of them lie still. There is very little of note on the ganger corpses, save a crudely drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option1.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to outmanuver the gangers, but the volley of fire directed their way was too intense. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the savage cries of the gangers resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2=Search the battlefield for an advantage
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome0.Detail=This particular group of gangers is near several pipe-systems that carry various forms of promethium. Unfortunatly, their brief existences will be cut short by a few well-placed shots which cause a massive explosion. After the flames die down, a passage has been newly revealed that leads to an unusual section of the underhive... 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome1.Detail=This particular group of gangers is near several pipe-systems that carry various forms of promethium. Unfortunatly, their brief existences will be cut short by a few well-placed shots which cause a massive explosion. Unfortunatly, {targetCouncilorFullName} was wounded in the ensuing fireball. After the flames die down, a passage has been newly revealed that leads to an unusual section of the underhive... 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome2=Critical Failure 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option2.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to find an advantage on the battlefield, but none were to be found.  Their distraction cost them dearly as the gangers focused their fire on {targetCouncilorFullName}'s position. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the savage cries of the gangers resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3=Command their retinue to assault the enemy
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome0=Critical success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome0.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command make quick work of the gangers, and they have routed in disarray. There is very little of note on the ganger corpses, save a crudely drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome1.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command make quick work of the gangers, and they have routed in disarray. However, some in {targetCouncilorFullName}'s retinue have fallen to the enemy. There is very little of note on the ganger corpses, save a crudely drawn map of some surrounding tunnels. {targetCouncilorFullName} uses this to their advantage and happens across a sector that is very different than the others...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2FightGangAbyss.option3.outcome2.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command attempt to hold off the horde, but there are simply too many of them. One after one, the members of {targetCouncilorFullName}'s retinue fall, slaughtered by the howling gangers. Finally, {targetCouncilorFullName} is all that remains. They succumb to their wounds as the world around them draws cold, with the savage cries of the gangers resounding in their ears...

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel=Collapsed Tunnel Blocks the Way
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} encounters a collapsed tunnel in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.query=In the Underhive, maintanence of critical support structures is sporadic at best near most human habitation, and nonexistent beyond. So it should come as no surprise when {targetCouncilorFullName} encounters a section of collapsed tunnels that blocks their path.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0=Clear the rubble by brute force
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome0=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome0.Detail=It takes a while, but the rubble is eventually cleared, leading to a surprise; the next area is surprisingly well-maintained, which instantly puts {targetCouncilorFullName} on guard...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome1=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome1.Detail=No amount of shovelling or removal of debris seems to make any progress, as more debris seems to keep filling in the gaps from above. This has wasted valuable time. 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome2=Hivequake!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option0.outcome2.Detail=During the removal of debris, a hivequake occurs and falling debris crtically injures {targetCouncilorFullName}. The expedition will have to be aborted until {targetCouncilorFullName} recovers.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1=Determine a structural weakness in the rubble
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome0=Critical Success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome0.Detail=Having analyzed the extent of the rubble and the surrounding structural supports for any weaknesses, {targetCouncilorFullName} fires several well-placed shots. The debris collapses under its own weight into the abyss, while the void left behind settles into a temporary equilibrium. Such a state is fleeting, but will serve as a temporary passage into the sections beyond.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} finds enough structural weaknesses to speed up the process of clearing out the debris field. The passage beyond is unlike aything seen so far in the Underhive...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option1.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} belives they found several structural weaknesses in the rubble. Unfortunatly, as soon as they fired, the whole section shifted and collapsed towards them, crushing them instantly under tons of rockcrete and steel.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2=Search for a way around the debris
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome0.Detail=During {targetCouncilorFullName}'s search, they notice the section of tunnel they are attempting to bypass contains a maintainence access point that has weathered the millenia in surprisingly good condition. It lead to another well-maintained section of the Underhive...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome1=Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempts to find a way around the debris, but to no avail. It will have to be removed in order to progress.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome2=CriticalFailure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option2.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} searches around and finds a side passage that seems to go in the same direction as the passage they wish to bypass. As they turn the corner, however, they encounter a group of mutants who were waiting in ambush!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3=Use a Heavy Weapon to remove the debris
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome0.Detail=Such is the destructive force of the weapon used by {targetCouncilorFullName} that it not only cleared out the debris, but also penetrated an ancient vault door that was hidden behind the rubble! {targetCouncilorFullName} hopes that the vault contents are still left intact...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome1.Detail=The debris blocking the way forward was easily cleared using the destructive tools available to {targetCouncilorFullName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive2BlockerTunnel.option3.outcome2.Detail=The moment {targetCouncilorFullName} fired their first shot, the entire section rumbled alarmingly!  Before they could react, the ceiling collapsed upon them, burying them under tons of rockcrete and steel.

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance=Vault of the Ancients
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} discovers the entrance to an ancient vault in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.query=This section of the Underhive is vastly different from the others. It is fully powered and well-lit, for one. The air is still stale, but it is more the staleness of air undisturbed for millenia rather than pollutants choking {targetCouncilorFullName}'s throat. {targetCouncilorFullName} stands in front of an ancient vault door with strange glyphs worn with age: "...MPUS..STRUCTION... ARCHIVE ALPHA-XX..."
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0=Cut through the door
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome0=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome0.Detail=It takes a while, but the Vault door eventually succumbs to the ministrations of the arco-welder wielded by {targetCouncilorFullName}. Stepping through the hole, {targetCouncilorFullName} is struck speechless by what they see beyond...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome1=Partial Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome1.Detail=The initial attempt to cut through the door was a failure, so {targetCouncilorFullName} had to resort to more drastic measures. The explosives used to blow open the door did succeed in cracking it open; however, the resultant shower of debris wounded {targetCouncilorFullName} despite their precautions. Stepping through the hole, {targetCouncilorFullName} is struck speechless by what they see beyond...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome2=Ancient Defences!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option0.outcome2.Detail=The moment the vault door was touched, ancient alarums sounded and defensive automata appear around the corner!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1=Attempt to override the lock
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome0.Detail=Not just the vault door, but the entire subcomplex housing the vault acknowledged {targetCouncilorFullName} as its master and admitted them. Any secrets that may have been hidden are now theirs to discover.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} is able to override the vault door controls. {targetCouncilorFullName} is struck speechless by what they see beyond...  
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome2=Ancient Defences!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option1.outcome2.Detail=The override attempt was detected! Ancient alarums sound and defensive automata appear around the corner!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2=Use a Heavy Weapon to breach the vault door
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome0=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome0.Detail=The door blocking the way forward was easily breached using the destructive tools available to {targetCouncilorFullName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome1=Partial Success.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome1.Detail=Surprisingly, the vault door withstood many shots before succumbing, and right after the breach was opened, {targetCouncilorFullName} took a glancing blow from debris. Stepping through the hole, {targetCouncilorFullName} is struck speechless by what they see beyond...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome2=Ancient Defences!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option2.outcome2.Detail=The moment the vault door was fired upon, ancient alarums sounded and defensive automata appear around the corner! {targetCouncilorFullName} now has more important targets to neutralize....
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3=Use archeotech to gain access
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome0.Detail=Not just the vault door, but the entire subcomplex housing the vault acknowledged {targetCouncilorFullName} as its master and admitted them. Any secrets that may have been hidden are now theirs to discover.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome1=Success 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} is able to override the vault door controls. {targetCouncilorFullName} is struck speechless by what they see beyond...  
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome2=Ancient Defences!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultEntrance.option3.outcome2.Detail=Whatever the protocols were in the past, they were evidently not recognized by the vault mechanism! Ancient alarums sound and defensive automata appear around the corner!

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight=Battling the Ancient Automata 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} battles a group of automata in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.query=Having triggered the ancient vault's security systems, {targetCouncilorFullName} must now deal with several heavily-armed automata. Their dull metal carapaces are adorned with the same sigils as the vault door, and their autoguns and laser arrays screech menacingly. {targetCouncilorFullName} notices that they appear sluggish, as if they have not yet fully awoken from their millenia-long sleep. At this point, it matters not, for battle is joined!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0=Charge the Enemy!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome0=Critical Success!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome0.Detail=The charge was successful! The automata were not expecting the ferocious charge of {targetCouncilorFullName}, and they were unable to shoot effectivly as {targetCouncilorFullName} wove among them, smashing them one by one. The remains of the automata appear to be made of an advanced alloy, what little there is to be salvaged. With the defences neutralized, {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to take the time to plunder the vault...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome1=Failure.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome1.Detail=The charge was unsuccessful. {targetCouncilorFullName} was forced to take cover as the return fire bcame too intense. A stray shot wounded them, but they are not out of the fight yet...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option0.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to charge the automata, but the volley of fire directed their way was too intense. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the electronic screeches of the automata resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1=Use superior tactics to outmanuver them
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome0.Detail=Using superior battle tactics, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to outmanuver the automata and defeat them in detail. The electronic screams of of the automata fall silent as the last of them lie still. The remains of the automata appear to be made of an advanced alloy, what little there is to be salvaged. With the defences neutralized, {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to take the time to plunder the vault...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome1.Detail=Using battle tactics, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to outmanuver the automata and defeat them in detail. However, they were wounded in the crossfire. The electronic screams of the automata fall silent as the last of them lie still. The remains of the automata appear to be made of an advanced alloy, what little there is to be salvaged. With the defences neutralized, {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to take the time to plunder the vault...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option1.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to outmanuver the automata, but the volley of fire directed their way was too intense. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the electronic screeches of the automata resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2=Attempt to override the automata's security protocols
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome0=Critical Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome0.Detail=For some reason, possibly that of the lowest-bidding contractor, the automata all share a linked ally-ident network, which happened to share the same protocols with the door controls. {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to override the security alert and shut down the automata. The carapaces of the automata appear to be made of an advanced alloy, while their autoguns and laser arrays may provide improvements to our own weapons sytems after sufficent study.  With the defences neutralized, {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to take the time to plunder the vault...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome1.Detail=For some reason, possibly that of the lowest-bidding contractor, the automata all share a linked ally-ident network, which happened to share the same protocols with the door controls. {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to override the security alert and shut down the automata, but not without being wounded in the process. The carapaces of the automata appear to be made of an advanced alloy, while their autoguns and laser arrays may provide improvements to our own weapons sytems after sufficent study.  With the defences neutralized, {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to take the time to plunder the vault...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome2=Critical Failure 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option2.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} attempted to determine a way of shutting down the security alert, but to no avail.  Their distraction cost them dearly as the automata focused their fire on {targetCouncilorFullName}'s position. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the electronic screeches of the automata resounding in their ears...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3=Command their retinue to assault the enemy
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome0=Critical success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome0.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command make quick work of the automata, and they lie in pieces upon the floor. The remains of the automata appear to be made of an advanced alloy, what little there is to be salvaged. With the defences neutralized, {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to take the time to plunder the vault...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome1=Success
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome1.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command make quick work of the automata, and they lie in pieces upon the floor. However, some in {targetCouncilorFullName}'s retinue have fallen to the enemy. The remains of the automata appear to be made of an advanced alloy, what little there is to be salvaged. With the defences neutralized, {targetCouncilorFullName} is now free to take the time to plunder the vault...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome2=Critical Failure
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive3CompanyVaultFight.option3.outcome2.Detail=The forces under {targetCouncilorFullName}'s command attempt to assault the automata, but thier armor and weaponry are simply too powerful. One after one, the members of {targetCouncilorFullName}'s retinue fall, slaughtered by the screeching automata. Finally, {targetCouncilorFullName} is all that remains. They succumbed to their wounds as the world around them drew cold, with the electronic screeches of the automata resounding in their ears...

TINarrativeEventTemplate.displayName.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward=Vault of the Ancients Reward
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.summary={targetCouncilorFullName} enjoys the spoils of an ancient vault in the Underhive of {secondaryTargetHabName}.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.query=Having neutralized the defences of the ancient vault, {targetCouncilorFullName} now gets to enjoy the spoils of the expedition...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0=Examine the Vault interior
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.optionDetail0=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome0=Gold!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome0.Detail=Gold, stacks and stacks of it, lie in neat rows the entire width and breadth of the vault. The stab-lights that shine upon them cause sparkling lights to shine throughout the mirror finish of the vault. Now the only problem is how to haul it back to the surface...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome1=Archival Datavault
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome1.Detail=This vault appears to contain backup records of the administrative and business operations of an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. On first glance, it appears to be of no relevance to {actorNameWithArticleCap}, but perhaps data-adepts will be able to make some use of it.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome2=Nothing!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option0.outcome2.Detail=Despite many anxious minutes of searching, the only thing inside the vault is an ancient terminal which is singulary unhelpful in explaining why the vault is devoid of anything. {targetCouncilorFullName}'s best guess is that the vault was constructed to hold something of value and then abandoned before it was transferred. Unfortunatly, the only treasure this expedition will return is {targetCouncilorFullName}'s continued existence...
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1=Investigate the Vault for any hidden caches or areas
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.optionDetail1=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome0=Gold!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome0.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was able to discover a recessed panel in the vault, revealing an entire sublevel! Bars of gold lie in neatly ordered rows the entire width and breadth of it. The stab-lights that shine upon them cause sparkling lights to shine throughout the mirror finish of the vault. The primary vault appears to contain backup records of the administrative and business operations of an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. On first glance, it appears to be of no relevance to {actorNameWithArticleCap}, but perhaps data-adepts will be able to make some use of it.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome1=Hive Construction Plans Archive
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was able to discover a recessed panel in the vault, revealing a terminal that contains original plans and templates for many systems used in the construction of Hive Cities. Apparently, this is a backup archive for an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. They were quite prolific in the arcology construction business, and may have formed the foundations for many of the Hives still active today.  The primary vault appears to contain many models, prototpyes, and dioramas for the various construction projects OCS has constructed over the millenia, ranging from minature fusion reactors to mega-arcologies. The prototypes may of some interest to our researchers.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome2=Archival Datavault
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option1.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to find anything else besides what is already contained in the vault. This vault appears to contain backup records of the administrative and business operations of an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. On first glance, it appears to be of no relevance to {actorNameWithArticleCap}, but perhaps data-adepts will be able to make some use of it.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2=Search the Terminal for Research Data
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.optionDetail2=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome0=STC Fragment!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome0.Detail=After an intense data-duel with the vault's firewalls and intruder annihilation protocols, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to subdue them and gain full access to the vault's secure networks.  On the surface, this is a backup archive for an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. They were quite prolific in the arcology construction business, and may have formed the foundations for many of the Hives still active today.  This barely scratches the surface, however, as Olympus Systems was also a participant in the creation of the Standard Template Constructor. Their contribution to the project consisted primarily of their area of expertise, namely arcology construction and required subsytems. This archive contains an encrypted portion of their contribution, which will require significant research efforts to decipher. In addtion, {targetCouncilorFullName} is able to download an OCS private key, which may allow them to bypass security protocols in similar systems.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome1=Hive Construction Plans Archive
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome1.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was able to interface with the main terminal and discovered a subnet that contains original plans and templates for many systems used in the construction of Hive Cities. Apparently, this is a backup archive for an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. They were quite prolific in the arcology construction business, and may have formed the foundations for many of the Hives still active today.  The primary vault appears to contain many models, prototpyes, and dioramas for the various construction projects OCS has constructed over the millenia, ranging from minature fusion reactors to mega-arcologies. The prototypes may of some interest to our researchers.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome2=Archival Datavault
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option2.outcome2.Detail={targetCouncilorFullName} was unable to find anything else besides what is already contained in the vault. This vault appears to contain backup records of the administrative and business operations of an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. On first glance, it appears to be of no relevance to {actorNameWithArticleCap}, but perhaps data-adepts will be able to make some use of it.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3=Reveal the Secrets of the Vault
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.optionDetail3=<skip/>
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome0=STC Fragment!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome0.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome0.Detail=With full access to all vault subsystems, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to retrieve highly classified data from the vault's secure networks.  On the surface, this is a backup archive for an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. They were quite prolific in the arcology construction business, and may have formed the foundations for many of the Hives still active today.  This barely scratches the surface, however, as Olympus Systems was also a participant in the creation of the Standard Template Constructor. Their contribution to the project consisted primarily of their area of expertise, namely arcology construction and required subsytems. This archive contains an encrypted portion of their contribution, which will require significant research efforts to decipher. In addtion, {targetCouncilorFullName} is able to download an OCS private key, which may allow them to bypass security protocols in similar systems.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome1=GOLD!
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome1.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome1.Detail=With full access to all vault subsystems, {targetCouncilorFullName} became aware of an entire sublevel benath the main vault! Bars of gold lie in neatly ordered rows the entire width and breadth of it. The stab-lights that shine upon them cause sparkling lights to shine throughout the mirror finish of the vault. The primary vault appears to contain backup records of the administrative and business operations of an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. On first glance, it appears to be of no relevance to {actorNameWithArticleCap}, but perhaps data-adepts will be able to make some use of it. In addtion, {targetCouncilorFullName} is able to download an OCS private key, which may allow them to bypass security protocols in similar systems.
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome2=Hive Construction Plans Archive
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome2.Summary={actorNameWithArticleCap} 
TINarrativeEventTemplate.event_VaultHabModuleHiveUnderhive4CompanyVaultReward.option3.outcome2.Detail=With full access to all vault subsystems, {targetCouncilorFullName} was able to discover a recessed panel in the vault, revealing a terminal that contains original plans and templates for many systems used in the construction of Hive Cities. Apparently, this is a backup archive for an ancient organization known as Olympus Construction Systems. They were quite prolific in the arcology construction business, and may have formed the foundations for many of the Hives still active today.  The primary vault appears to contain many models, prototpyes, and dioramas for the various construction projects OCS has constructed over the millenia, ranging from minature fusion reactors to mega-arcologies. The prototypes may of some interest to our researchers. In addtion, {targetCouncilorFullName} is able to download an OCS private key, which may allow them to bypass security protocols in similar systems.






TIMissionCondition_HasVaultModule=There must be an unexplored Vault Module on the Hab

