TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHimalazianGeneLab.Start=I entered the archival datastacks of the Himalazian Gene-Labs in search of data related to the experiments performed here.
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHimalazianGeneLab.SuccessProject= I discovered information relating to a rejuv treatment in the datastacks.
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHimalazianGeneLab.SuccessRepeat= I discovered additional archival data relating to the rejuv treatments that may help wth our future research. ( {0} )
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHimalazianGeneLab.CriticalSuccessProject= I discovered information relating to a rejuv treatment in the datastacks. I have also acquired {0} from the archival datastacks. 
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHimalazianGeneLab.CriticalSuccessRepeat= I discovered additional archival data relating to the rejuv treatments that may help wth our future research.
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHimalazianGeneLab.Failure= I was unable to find anything of interest near {targetDisplayName} at {targetHabName}. This does not mean nothing exists, just that I need more time.
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHimalazianGeneLab.CriticalFailure= Unfortunatly, I was detected in a secure area near the {targetDisplayName} at {targetHabName}, and I am being detained for questioning.

TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHiveUnderhive.Start=I entered the {targetDisplayName} of {targetHabName} in order to find archeotech lost in the depths.
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHiveUnderhive.SuccessProjectHeavyFusionReactorsRestored= I discovered original blueprints and templates for the hive's fusion reactors. 
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHiveUnderhive.SuccessRepeatHeavyFusionReactorsRestored= I discovered additional archival data relating to the fusion reactors that may help wth our future research. ( {0} )
TIMissionEffect_ExploreVault.HabModuleHiveUnderhive.Failure= I was unable to find anything of interest near {targetDisplayName} at {targetHabName}. This does not mean nothing exists, just that I need more time.
